"j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"74:30","t":"Over it are nineteen [angels].","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"74:31","t":"And We have not made the keepers of the Fire except angels. And We have not made their number except as a trial for those who disbelieve - that those who were given the Scripture will be convinced and those who have believed will increase in faith and those who were given the Scripture and the believers will not doubt and that those in whose hearts is disease [i.e., hypocrisy] and the disbelievers will say, \"What does Allāh intend by this as an example?\" Thus does Allāh send astray whom He wills and guide whom He wills. And none knows the soldiers of your Lord except Him. And it [i.e., mention of the Fire] is not but a reminder to humanity.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"74:32","t":"No! By the moon.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"74:33","t":"And [by] the night when it departs.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"74:34","t":"And [by] the morning when it brightens,","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"74:35","t":"Indeed, it [i.e., the Fire] is of the greatest [afflictions].","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"74:36","t":"As a warning to humanity -","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"74:37","t":"To whoever wills among you to proceed or stay behind.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"74:38","t":"Every soul, for what it has earned, will be retained.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"74:39","t":"Except the companions of the right,.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"74:40","t":"[Who will be] in gardens, questioning each other","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"74:41","t":"About the criminals,","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"74:42","t":"[And asking them], \"What put you into Saqar?\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"74:43","t":"They will say, \"We were not of those who prayed,","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"74:44","t":"Nor did we used to feed the poor.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"74:45","t":"And we used to enter into vain discourse with those who engaged [in it],","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"74:46","t":"And we used to deny the Day of Recompense","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"74:47","t":"Until there came to us the certainty [i.e., death].\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":47,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":58,"surahs":[74],"sajdah":false}